B.a4v=new A.Y(B.a7h,["Nunua {p}","Uza {p}","juu kuliko jana","chini kuliko jana","sawa na jana","{g}: nunua {b}, uza {s}, {t}. Fungua kuona maelezo.","Nunua kwa: {m}, {p}","Uza kwa: {m}, {p}","Gunia lako","Gunia lako ni tupu. Nunua kitu cha bei nafuu, kiuze bei ikipanda.","{g}, {n} kwenye gunia lako","{g}, {n} kwenye gunia lako, thamani yake ni {p}% zaidi ya ulivyolipa","{g}, {n} kwenye gunia lako, thamani yake ni {p}% pungufu ya ulivyolipa","{g}, {n} kwenye gunia lako, thamani yake ni sawa na ulivyolipa","Zilizoongezwa (posho)","Weka barua pepe yako ili ujiunge na chama","Kubali","Omba deni","Kielezo cha bei ya kapu","Kabla ya kuanza","Bei za leo","Bei bora ya kuuza {p} kwa {m}","Nunua","Nunua kwa {p}","Kununua {q} kunagharimu {c}. Kuuza {s} kunaleta takriban {r} kabla ya ushuru wa soko.","Chama","Chama (nunua pamoja)","Wanachama wa chama wanahitaji akaunti iliyohifadhiwa ili kikundi kiaminiane. Tutakutumia kiungo cha kuingia kwa barua pepe.","Funga siku","Msimbo kutoka kwenye kiungo","Mfuko wa pamoja {p}","Thibitisha","Kikomo cha deni {l} \xb7 unadaiwa {o}","Siku ya {d}","Daftari la siku","Kataa","Futa akaunti yangu (huondoa barua pepe)","Deni","Deni (mkopo)","Linadaiwa baada ya siku {n} (siku ya {d})","Duka","Duka lako","{g} kwa {m}","Bidhaa kwa deni","Nenda jioni","Nenda adhuhuri","Kura ya kikundi","Bembeleza bei","Nakubali kutumiwa kiungo cha kuingia kwa barua pepe na barua pepe yangu ihifadhiwe kwa akaunti hii.","Nina miaka 18 au zaidi. Anza","Nina chini ya miaka 18","Jiunge (hisa {p})","Wanachama {n} kati ya {max}","Kuna mzigo unasubiri kura.","Ombi hili ni lako. Wanachama wengine wanapiga kura.","Riba ya {r}%, kutoka chama chako","Riba ya {r}%, kutoka kwa mfanyabiashara","Karibu sokoni. Mchezo wa biashara ya sokoni.","Mzigo unaotolewa: {q} {g}","Soko: {m} \xb7 {c} \xb7 v{v}","Soko halipatikani. Jaribu hali ya majaribio.","{m} \xb7 {n} zimebaki","Jumla ya siku","Siku inayofuata","inayofuata baada ya {t}","awamu inayofuata karibuni","Bado hakuna chama hapa.","Bado hakuna maelezo.","Hakuna mzigo unaotolewa leo.","Huna deni. Uko vizuri.","Pointi hazitoshi kwa kiasi hiki.","Bado hakuna kilichoandikwa siku hii.","{n} (wewe)","Hali ya majaribio bila mtandao","Umechelewa: ada za kuchelewa zinaongezeka","Unadaiwa {p}","Cheza kama mgeni (bila barua pepe)","Cheza sasa kama mgeni. Weka barua pepe baadaye ili kuhifadhi maendeleo kwenye kifaa kingine au kujiunga na chama.","Unacheza na soko lililo ndani ya programu. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote.","Cheza majaribio bila mtandao badala yake","Pointi","Pointi (pts) ni za mchezo tu. Haziwezi kununuliwa, kutumwa wala kubadilishwa kuwa pesa.","Pointi ni za mchezo tu. Haziwezi kubadilishwa kuwa pesa.","Bei ya pamoja {t}. Sehemu yako ya gharama: {s}.","Siku iliyopita","Pts zinazoingia na kutoka sokoni","Pts pamoja na thamani ya mzigo, toa unachodaiwa.","pts / kipimo","{q} {g} kutoka kwa {m}","Kiasi","Radio Soko","Radio Soko: bado hakuna habari.","Orodha ya viwango","Orodha ya viwango haipatikani.","Zilizotolewa (ushuru, ada, kuharibika)","Lipa","Sifa","Sifa: {t}. Lipa kwa wakati ili kuongeza kikomo chako.","Ripoti","Uza","Uza kwa {p}","Wakununua kwa: {p}","Mipangilio","Soko","Soko Kuu ni kwa wachezaji wenye miaka 18 au zaidi. Tafadhali rudi ukifikisha umri huo.","Ripoti ya Soko","Samahani","Huharibika: karibu 10% hupotea kila usiku","Anzisha changu","Anza kucheza","Chukua bidhaa kwa deni","Soko hufanya biashara adhuhuri. Rudi wakati huo.","\u2022 Hakuna zawadi wala bahati nasibu ya kulipia. Bei hufuata kanuni zilizowekwa za soko.","\u2022 Mchezo huu ni kwa watu wenye miaka 18 na zaidi.","Hali ya wafanyabiashara","Jaribu tena","Thamani {c}. Utadaiwa takriban {o} (riba ya 6%) ndani ya siku 5. Madeni yaliyochelewa huongezeka.","Kura inafungwa siku ya {d} (siku {n} zimebaki).","Kwa nini bei hii","Unashikilia {n}","\u2022 Unacheza kwa pointi (pts). Pts ni za mchezo tu: haziwezi kununuliwa, kutumwa wala kubadilishwa kuwa pesa.","Bora yako binafsi: {n}","Ufunguo wako wa kucheza umehifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki. Kwenye wavuti ni ufunguo wa majaribio tu: ukifuta data ya tovuti utaanza mchezaji mpya.","(yako)","Alama zako","Rafu zako ni tupu. Nunua kitu sokoni ili kuanza.","Umepiga kura {v}. Matokeo yatasomwa siku ikifungwa.","{y} ndiyo \xb7 {no} hapana \xb7 wanachama {n}","Vipi kama? Songa mbele","Onyesho la soko. Halibadilishi mchezo wako.","Siku {n}","Hakuna mshtuko","Ukame","Mazao mengi","Endesha onyesho","Onyesho halikuweza kuendeshwa.","Hiyo ni zaidi ya kikomo chako cha deni ({l}). Chama kinaweza kukopesha kilichobaki, lakini hujajiunga na chama. Jiunge na kimoja kwenye kichupo cha Chama.","Hiyo ni zaidi ya kikomo chako cha deni ({l}). Mfuko wa pamoja wa chama chako una {c}, hautoshi kulipia {n}. Omba kidogo zaidi, au alika wanachama: chama cha wanachama 4 hivi kina fedha za kutosha.","Chama hukopesha kutoka kwenye mfuko wa pamoja tu ({c}, wanachama {m}). Wanachama chini ya 4 hivi kwa kawaida hawana fedha za kutosha kwa ombi kubwa, kwa hiyo kura haifunguliwi.","Sawa","Alfajiri","Adhuhuri","Jioni","ndiyo","hapana","Mgeni","Mfanyabiashara","Mzoefu","Ungependa kucheza vipi?","Cheza Soko Run","Siku tano za soko kwa haraka kwenye simu hii. Hakuna kuingia, hakuna kinachotumwa popote.","Soko la moja kwa moja kwenye NEAR","Soko la pamoja lenye chama, mikopo na wachezaji wengine.","Unaweza kubadilisha baadaye.","Siku tano za soko kwa haraka, bila mtandao. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote.","Rudi kwenye Soko Run","Nyanya","Mahindi","Sukuma wiki","nyanya","mahindi","sukuma wiki","Siku tano za soko. Sikiliza Radio Soko, nunua kwa bei ya chini, uza kwa bei ya juu.","Cheza soko lako la kwanza","Cheza soko jipya","Soko la Leo #{n}","Bora yako: {n} pts.","Soko la Leo ni siku 5 zilezile kwa kila mtu leo.","Sauti","Mtetemo","Siku {d} kati ya {n}","Leo #{n}","Soko la kwanza","Mazoezi","Thamani ya gunia {n}","Jumla {n}","Radio Soko ilisema kweli.","Radio Soko imekosea safari hii.","Bei zimepanda.","Bei zimeshuka.","Bei ya {g} imepanda kutoka {a} hadi {b}.","Bei ya {g} imeshuka kutoka {a} hadi {b}.","Bei ya {g} imebaki {a}.","Bei ya {g} imebaki karibu na {b}.","Bei zimebaki karibu na kawaida.","Siku ya mwisho","Soko linafungwa leo usiku. Kila kitu kwenye gunia lako kinauzwa kwa bei za leo.","Radio Soko husema kweli takriban mara 3 kati ya 4.","Radio Soko inasema bei ya nyanya itapanda. Gusa **Nunua** kwenye Nyanya mara chache, kisha gusa **Siku inayofuata**.","Umesoma vizuri! Bei ikipanda ghafla hushuka kesho yake, kwa hiyo **uza nyanya zako sasa**.","Funga kidokezo","leo","sawa","Una {n}","(imejaa)","{p}% ukilinganisha na ulicholipa","Nunua {g} moja kwa {p} pts","Uza {g} moja kwa {p} pts","Funga soko","Soko limefungwa.","Alama mpya bora!","Bora yako: {n}","Sahihi mara {x} kati ya {n}.","Hatua bora","Hatua mbaya zaidi","Uliuza {g} {q} siku ya {d} kwa {p}","Uliuza {g} {q} wakati wa kufunga kwa {p}","Ukilinganisha na kutofanya chochote","Mchezaji ambaye hakufanya biashara alimaliza na {n} pts.","Siku kwa siku: {u} juu, {d} chini, {f} sawa","Unaweza kunishinda?","Nakili","Imenakiliwa","Cheza tena","Rudi mwanzo"],t.w)
